<title>RUSSIA: Russian Pallada GKO fund assets 265 mln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russian Pallada GKO fund assets 265 mln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pallada Government Securities Unit Investment Fund, which started operating on November 12, said on Thursday that its net assets totalled 265,345,954 roubles.</p>
<p>A unit in the fund costs 10,000 roubles, a fund spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
